  "title": "macOS: Require Sparkle 1 for now.",
  "description": "The Sparkle project recently released Sparkle 2.0.0, which deprecates\nthe version 1 API. Add version discovery to FindSparkle.cmake and\nrequire version 1 until we add support for the new API. Ping #17861.",
